ok><name>OTA, TOSHIO</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>WAKAMATSU, AI</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>ISOGAI TAKAO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>MITSUHASHI MASATO</name><address><country>US</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>OTA TOSHIO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>WAKAMATSU AI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>ISOGAI, TAKAO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>MITSUHASHI, MASATO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>OTA, TOSHIO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>WAKAMATSU, AI</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>Libraries of sense strand cDNA immobilized in the 5'-side. An artificial known base sequence is added to the 3'-side of an antisense cDNA strand (the first strand) and the 5'-side of the second strand is immobilized by using a primer complementary to the above base sequence. Thus, a cDNA library with excellent qualities, which contain the full-length cDNA at a high possibility, can be obtained.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention concerne des banques d'ADNc brin sens immobilisés sur l'extrémité 5', et consiste à ajouter une séquence de base connue, artificielle, à l'extrémité 3' d'un brin d'ADNc antisens (premier brin) et à immobiliser l'extrémité 5' du second brin, en ajoutant une amorce complémentaire de la séquence de base ci-dessus. De cette manière, on obtient une banque d'ADNc possédant d'excellentes qualités et contenant des ADNc complets à fort potentiel.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>